Comment: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:28.29,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.94,0:00:07.61,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Uite! O stea căzătoare!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.91,0:00:13.99,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sunt îndrăgostit de prietena \Nmea din copilărie, Marika.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.54,0:00:17.66,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ea este foarte populară \Ncu toți colegii din clasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.12,0:00:21.58,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Iar eu sunt atât de nepopular \Nîncât o să mor singur!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.88,0:00:23.17,Dialogue,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,{\an8}Băiatul acela e așa de \Nplictisitor, nu crezi?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.17,0:00:24.55,Dialogue,GIRL 2,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nici nu știam că e cu noi în clasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.55,0:00:27.88,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Nu cred că vreo fată ar fi interesată de mine \Nnici măcar dacă mi-aș vinde sufletul!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.13,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Te rog!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.88,0:00:34.43,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fă-mă să văd afecțiunea celorlalte persoane, \Nexact ca într-un joc cu întâlniri!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.85,0:00:37.06,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Scuze de întârziere! \NM-ai așteptat mult?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.31,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Te rog...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.31,0:00:40.94,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Te implor!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.94,0:00:46.69,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1\t(4940,5750,\alpha&HFF&)}Vreau să văd cât de \Nmult mă place Marika!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.70,Dialogue,SUMO,0,0,0,,Suntem gata! \NSuntem pregătiți!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:48.95,0:00:50.61,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,'Neața.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.61,0:00:52.16,Dialogue,GIRL 3,0,0,0,,Hei, 'neața.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.12,0:00:59.41,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}C-Ce naiba...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.75,0:01:08.09,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,40)}Fetele au un termometru lângă ele?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:08.80,0:01:10.51,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și doar fetele au așa ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.01,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}A-A-Asta înseamnă că...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.30,0:01:14.01,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,{\an8}'Neața, Kitami!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:15.05,0:01:17.89,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Ce cauți întins pe jos?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:20.31,0:01:22.81,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Termometrul lui Mikasa este la jumătate.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.81,0:01:24.48,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oare e normal să fie așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.23,0:01:26.90,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ai o petală în păr...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:31.57,0:01:33.78,Dialogue,MIKASA,0,0,0,,Ah… Mersi.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.78,0:01:36.95,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,720)}A crescut aproape la maximum!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:38.16,0:01:39.16,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.71,0:01:42.00,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Kitami…
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.00,0:01:45.88,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Cine naiba ți-a spus că te poți \Npune cu fundul pe banca mea?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.13,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Î-Îmi pare rău, Toyotomi!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.13,0:01:50.47,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}S-a dus la fund ca Titanicul!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.88,0:01:54.30,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew it, I really can see\Nhow people think of me.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.30,0:01:55.47,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Iar asta înseamnă că...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.47,0:01:57.14,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,'Neața!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.14,0:01:59.89,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}N-Nu e asta vocea lui Marika?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.64,0:01:59.22,Dialogue,BOY 1,0,0,0,,{\an8}'Neața, Chitose!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:59.89,0:02:02.48,Dialogue,BOY 2,0,0,0,,Chitose e așa de drăguță!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.43,0:02:03.69,Dialogue,BOY 3,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oare are vreun băiat de care-i place?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.85,0:02:06.77,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1\t(3340,3920,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&)}Mă întreb cum arată \Ntermometrul ei al afecțiunii.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.86,0:02:09.73,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,'Neața, Kanata!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.86,0:02:15.28,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Poftim?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.99,0:02:19.29,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Termometrul afecțiunii lui \NMarika s-a stricat complet!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.29,0:02:24.25,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.54,0:02:25.75,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}A fost cumva un vis?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.38,0:02:29.50,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Știai că această \Nînghețată e ediție limitată?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.50,0:02:32.26,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Și acum, Kanata, gura mare!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.26,0:02:34.51,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ce?! S-S-Stai...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.51,0:02:36.80,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,N-N-Nu s-s-sunt p-p-pregătit \Nî-î-încă p-p-pentru a-a-asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.06,0:02:43.39,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Era doar o glumă!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.39,0:02:44.35,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.23,0:02:47.23,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Te simți puțin mai bine acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.92,0:03:09.21,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Hei, Kanata.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.22,0:03:22.72,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Vai, acum ai făcut-o!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:28.31,0:03:30.36,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,C-Ce se petrece?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.11,0:03:35.53,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,U-Uua!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.99,0:03:40.58,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Kanata!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.83,0:03:48.46,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Acești pești sunt așa de perverși!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.88,0:03:50.96,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,N-Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.88,0:03:57.47,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Nu te mișca, te rog...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.80,0:04:02.51,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Kyanata.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.48,0:04:11.90,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,De ce nu ai ochi \Nnumai pentru mine?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.90,0:04:14.32,Dialogue,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,{\i1}Termometrul afecțiunii \Nnu greșește {\i0}niciodată{\i1}.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.32,0:04:18.07,Dialogue,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dar, pentru că iubirea ei \Npentru Kanata e mult prea grea,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.07,0:04:20.24,Dialogue,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,{\i1}termometrul nu \Na reușit să-i facă față.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.24,0:04:23.41,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Îl {\i1}voi{\i0} face să mă observe! Orice ar fi!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:23.41,0:04:27.58,Dialogue,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,{\i1}Va fi acest termometru \Ncupidonul lor sau...
